    {
      "id": "claim_a1db49538e8b4ed3b9a3baf37019c171",
      "statement": "Open SWE is an asynchronous software factory whose coding, reviewer, and review-scout threads run as a single `open-swe` graph in the separate Managed Deep Agents project; MDA owns the model loop, checkpoints, sandbox, tool calls, and middleware, while the backend exposes authenticated typed `/agent-api/{endpoint}` callbacks shared through `packages/runtime-api`.",
